        "zh-CN": "材料与润滑剂",
        "en-US": "Materials And Lubricant"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh-CN": "钢圈、陶瓷球和润滑剂共同决定 EHL 膜厚、介电常数和球体本体电容。",
        "en-US": "Rings, ceramic balls, and lubricant jointly determine EHL film thickness, permittivity, and ball-body capacitance."
      },
      "fields": [
        {
          "name": "ring_youngs_modulus_mpa",
          "kind": "number",
          "step": "any",
