            "zh-CN": "钢圈弹性模量",
            "en-US": "Ring Young's Modulus"
          },
          "help": {
            "zh-CN": "与陶瓷球模量一起决定等效模量。",
            "en-US": "Together with the ceramic modulus it sets the equivalent Hertzian modulus."
